> > raschfitfull=mirt(data, 1, 'Rasch')

>
> Iteration: 27, Log-Lik: -2664.901, Max-Change: 0.00010

>
> > coef(raschfitfull)

>
> Item.1
>     a1     d g u
> par  1 1.868 0 1

>
